# Docker build-context excludes (scaffold for apps/worker/Dockerfile, Task 13.5).
#
# node_modules MUST be excluded: pnpm's store uses symlinks to absolute host
# paths that would corrupt the image, and the build reinstalls from the frozen
# lockfile anyway. Everything else here just keeps the context small/clean.

# Dependencies (reinstalled inside the build stage)
node_modules
**/node_modules

# VCS / editor
.git
.gitignore
.githooks

# Build / test / coverage artifacts
.next
**/.next
dist
coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
playwright-report
test-results

# Secrets & local env (never bake into an image)
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Docs & specs (not needed at runtime)
.sdd
specs
docs
**/tests
**/*.spec.ts
